{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>In order to afflict them with their burdens.</b> An expression of diminution of marital relations, as in ״אם תענה את בנותי״ — meaning that they would diminish serving their beds on account of their burdens, and all this to fulfill ״וענו אותם״." "And so our Rabbis said: ״את ענינו״ — this is separation from marital relations."], :book :exodus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:55:39.012756248Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}